Source: yserver
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Jos Dehaes <jos.dehaes@gmail.com>
# No cargo/rustc: yserver needs Rust >= 1.87 (u32::is_multiple_of,
# cast_unsigned) and Debian trixie ships 1.85, so `rustc (>= 1.87)` would be
# unsatisfiable and dpkg-buildpackage would refuse before starting. The
# toolchain is supplied out of band (rustup / the CI rust action) and must be
# on PATH. That is fine for a .deb we ship ourselves — installing it needs no
# toolchain at all — but it does mean this is not archive-policy clean.
